  "description": "Clear, punchy, close rap main vocal with a slightly dark character - CLEARER + MORE REVERB version: more presence (3.5 kHz) and air (12 kHz), less mud, softer warmth, quieter demon layer, a longer hall (1.8 s) with 45 ms pre-delay and a low cut so the words stay in front. Gentle gate, light natural VocalTune 2, soft de-esser, 3:1 compressor, limiter -1.5 dB.",
